			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>All the electronic &amp; speaker gadgets going into Bessie&#8230;</p>
<div id="attachment_127" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208237906872_116764945017868_220523_6206079_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-127" title="Gadgets" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208237906872_116764945017868_220523_6206079_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Gadgets" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Lots of gadgets, lots of them dirt cheap from China</p></div>
<div id="attachment_128" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208241240205_116764945017868_220524_7574202_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-128" title="Reading material" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208241240205_116764945017868_220524_7574202_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Reading material" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Essential reading material</p></div>
<div id="attachment_129" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208247906871_116764945017868_220525_1466588_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-129" title="LAT-500 subwoofer" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208247906871_116764945017868_220525_1466588_n-300x225.jpg" alt="LAT-500 subwoofer" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">My Tymphany LAT-500 transducer subwoofer. It&#39;s a lot bigger than it looks in the picture.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_130" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208254573537_116764945017868_220526_4718431_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-130" title="Tang Band W6-1721" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208254573537_116764945017868_220526_4718431_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Tang Band W6-1721" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">My Tang Band W6-1721. It weighs about 15 lbs, that magnet ain&#39;t no joke.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_131" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208261240203_116764945017868_220527_5843503_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-131" title="Speaker set" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121208261240203_116764945017868_220527_5843503_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Speaker set" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">The complete set. Trying to decide which of the crappy speakers go in the front door panels</p></div>
<div id="attachment_132" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209337906762_116764945017868_220536_40307_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-132" title="Beautiful sound" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209337906762_116764945017868_220536_40307_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Beautiful sound" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Beautiful, beautiful sound.  Can't wait to install it and fire it up...yeehaw.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_133" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209347906761_116764945017868_220537_3635993_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-133" title="Car PC" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209347906761_116764945017868_220537_3635993_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Car PC" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">My Car PC. It has no hard drive. Running XP off a USB key is a bitch and a half, but worth it...once I figure out how to make a backup.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_134" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209357906760_116764945017868_220538_6910208_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-134" title="Touchscreen" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209357906760_116764945017868_220538_6910208_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Touchscreen" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Touchscreen, again from China, again dirt cheap. Slightly frightened to tear the casing off the LCD on the laptop, but oh well.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_135" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209367906759_116764945017868_220539_3081935_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-135" title="Badass speakers" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/29655_121209367906759_116764945017868_220539_3081935_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Badass speakers" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Not my picture, just hypothesizing about using open baffle speakers instead of cabinets and mounting them in the bed cab up top. Hell of a big and fun canvas to paint something on though.</p></div>


