			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>My 1984 Chevy Coachmen, before I turn her into an electronic battle weapon.</p>
<div id="attachment_102" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728014921561_116764945017868_205328_5309149_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-102" title="Bessie" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728014921561_116764945017868_205328_5309149_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Bessie" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Bessie in all her glory</p></div>
<div id="attachment_101" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728018254894_116764945017868_205329_212147_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-101" title="Cab" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728018254894_116764945017868_205329_212147_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Cab" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Inside the main cab, red circles are where the crazy speakers go, blue arrow is where the Car PC with GPS and backup cam go along with external soundcard for active crossovers. LCD touchscreen goes in the dash.</p></div>
<div id="attachment_99" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728021588227_116764945017868_205330_6080412_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-99 " title="Electronics" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/04/26294_117728021588227_116764945017868_205330_6080412_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Electronics" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Where the blue arrow points, soon to be filled with electronics galore</p></div>
<div id="attachment_90" class="wp-caption alignleft" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/26294_117728028254893_116764945017868_205331_5413419_n.jpg" rel="thumbnail"><img class="size-medium wp-image-90 " title="Speakers" src="http://blimpyb.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/26294_117728028254893_116764945017868_205331_5413419_n-300x225.jpg" alt="Speakers" width="300" height="225" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Current speakers blow, new speakers won&#39;t</p></div>


